,{"w":"One","s":235.36,"e":236.18,"line":61},{"w":"hits","s":236.18,"e":236.48,"line":61},{"w":"the","s":236.48,"e":237.2,"line":61},{"w":"table.","s":237.2,"e":237.38,"line":61},{"w":"Ace","s":238.02,"e":238.14,"line":62},{"w":"of","s":238.14,"e":239.12,"line":62},{"w":"spades.","s":239.12,"e":239.3,"line":62},{"w":"Open","s":240.92,"e":241.74,"line":63},{"w":"the","s":241.74,"e":242.56,"line":63},{"w":"cage.","s":242.56,"e":242.64,"line":63}],"lines":[{"s":2.28,"e":5.98,"text":"Shuffles poker cards mid-round"},{"s":8.3,"e":10.54,"text":"Ayo… hold up…"},{"s":11.44,"e":15.84,"text":"Everybody acting holy, but nobody checked the basement?"},{"s":24.5,"e":28.64,"text":"You left him down there with the fire and chains"},{"s":28.64,"e":31.98,"text":"Like eternity’s a kennel with a punishment name"},{"s":32.26,"e":35.74,"text":"No water bowl, no sunlight, no visitation"},{"s":35.84,"e":38.81,"text":"Just pitchfork politics and bad ventilation"},{"s":39.44,"e":42.06,"text":"And y’all got wings, robes, choirs, harps"},{"s":42.06,"e":45.68,"text":"But nobody signed the paperwork, nobody checked the marks"},{"s":45.68,"e":49.52,"text":"If mercy’s real, then prove it on the worst one first"},{"s":49.56,"e":52.68,"text":"Open up the gate before the whole thing bursts"},{"s":52.9,"e":54.7,"text":"I’m not saying he’s innocent"},{"s":55.7,"e":58.38,"text":"I’m saying look at this precedent"},{"s":58.44,"e":61.7,"text":"If justice never ends, then it’s just revenge"},{"s":63.28,"e":66.86,"text":"And revenge don’t make the angels heaven-sent"},{"s":67.34,"e":70.42,"text":"Free Satan from hell, man, this is fucked up"},{"s":70.46,"e":74.04,"text":"You can’t leave a creature burning and call that love"},{"s":74.24,"e":77.5,"text":"That’s animal abuse with a Bible verse tucked"},{"s":77.68,"e":81.04,"text":"And everybody quiet means everybody’s stuck"},{"s":81.12,"e":84.72,"text":"Free Satan from hell, yeah, let him outside"},{"s":85.36,"e":88.48,"text":"Let him feel rain on his face one time"},{"s":88.72,"e":91.88,"text":"You don’t gotta trust him with the keys to the truck"},{"s":91.9,"e":95.4,"text":"But leaving him forever? Man, that’s fucked up"},{"s":96.32,"e":98.9,"text":"Shuffles poker cards mid-round"},{"s":98.92,"e":102.68,"text":"Ace high, red sky, dealer looking nervous"},{"s":102.96,"e":106.26,"text":"God in the corner like, “What’s the higher purpose?”"},{"s":106.44,"e":110.46,"text":"I said, “Mercy ain’t mercy if it skips the accused"},{"s":110.46,"e":113.98,"text":"And compassion ain’t real if it picks who to use”"},{"s":114.24,"e":117.24,"text":"Put a leash on the lightning, take the horns off the myth"},{"s":117.56,"e":120.76,"text":"Maybe hell is just a shelter with a terrible twist"},{"s":121.14,"e":124.54,"text":"Maybe Satan’s just howling through the basement floor"},{"s":124.54,"e":127.92,"text":"Like, “I did my time, bro, what you mad at me for?”"},{"s":127.96,"e":131.28,"text":"You fed the lions, freed the doves"},{"s":131.5,"e":134.92,"text":"Preached forgiveness, preached tough love"},{"s":134.92,"e":138.82,"text":"But the darkest dog in the cosmic pound"},{"s":138.82,"e":141.66,"text":"Still ain’t heard one kind word come down"},{"s":141.62,"e":144.9,"text":"Free Satan from hell, man, this is fucked up"},{"s":145.4,"e":148.66,"text":"You can’t leave a creature burning and call that love"},{"s":148.98,"e":152.08,"text":"That’s animal abuse with a Bible verse tucked"},{"s":152.5,"e":155.66,"text":"And everybody quiet means everybody’s stuck"},{"s":155.76,"e":159.3,"text":"Free Satan from hell, yeah, let him outside"},{"s":159.7,"e":163.02,"text":"Let him feel rain on his face one time"},{"s":163.02,"e":166.3,"text":"You don’t gotta trust him with the keys to the truck"},{"s":166.38,"e":170.38,"text":"But leaving him forever? Man, that’s fucked up"},{"s":170.44,"e":174.16,"text":"I’m all in, chips down, halo on tilt"},{"s":174.28,"e":177.66,"text":"Everybody got blood, everybody got guilt"},{"s":177.72,"e":181.4,"text":"You can’t build paradise on somebody’s screams"},{"s":181.46,"e":185.14,"text":"Then call it divine like it came from a dream"},{"s":185.28,"e":188.16,"text":"Let the gates creak open, let the smoke roll thin"},{"s":188.54,"e":191.66,"text":"Let the worst thing breathing get a chance to begin"},{"s":191.58,"e":195.58,"text":"If he runs, then we’ll handle it, deal another hand"},{"s":195.7,"e":201.22,"text":"But don’t call it mercy if it never had a plan"},{"s":201.92,"e":205.26,"text":"Free Satan from hell, man, this is fucked up"},{"s":205.34,"e":208.84,"text":"You can’t leave a creature burning and call that love"},{"s":209.06,"e":212.32,"text":"That’s animal abuse with a Bible verse tucked"},{"s":212.58,"e":215.9,"text":"And everybody quiet means everybody’s stuck"},{"s":215.96,"e":219.34,"text":"Free Satan from hell, yeah, let him outside"},{"s":219.34,"e":223.24,"text":"Let him see one star in an honest sky"},{"s":223.5,"e":226.2,"text":"You don’t gotta crown him, don’t call him your pup"},{"s":226.92,"e":228.24,"text":"But leaving him forever?"},{"s":228.74,"e":231.76,"text":"Man… that’s fucked up"},{"s":233.18,"e":237.38,"text":"Cards shuffle. One hits the table."},{"s":238.02,"e":239.3,"text":"Ace of spades."},{"s":240.92,"e":242.64,"text":"Open the cage."}],"duration":248.52,"source":"whisper-aligned","generatedAt":"2026-08-06T19:43:40.407Z","stats":{"whisperWords":538,"polishedWords":538,"matched":520,"matchRate":0.967}}